        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: HMS Sussex\n- Organizations: English Royal Navy\n- Places: Kingdom of England, Great Britain, Scotland\n- Concepts: third-rate ship, ship of the line\n\nFacts:\n- HMS Sussex was an 80-gun third-rate ship of the line in the English Royal Navy.\n- The Kingdom of England existed on the island of Great Britain from the 10th century, when it emerged from various Anglo-Saxon kingdoms, until 1707.\n- In 1707, the Kingdom of England united with Scotland to form the Kingdom of Great Britain.",
